X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_ashevillehikinggroup
X-SOURCE:Asheville Hiking Group
UID:event_314500644@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260428T035241Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260430T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260430T193000
SUMMARY:Camino de Asheville. Section 4 - Approx 6.4 miles.
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nJoin me for an evening hike throug
 h the hills east of downtown Asheville\, exploring Windswept Dr.\, Helen's
  Bridge\, and downtown.\n\n**Meeting Spot:**\nWe'll gather at the Depot St
 . parking lot. GPS: 35.57991\, -82.56468\n\n**Pace:**\nWe'll be walking at
  a brisk 2.5 to 3.0 mph\, leaning more toward 3.0 mph\, even uphill. Pleas
 e be mindful of your fitness level\, but don’t worry—we'll take breaks
  at a few spots to let everyone catch up. While we’ll pause\, we can’t
  wait too long\, so come ready for a solid workout!\n\n**No-Shows:**\nI’
 ll be keeping an eye on no-shows. If you RSVP and don’t show up without 
 changing your RSVP or letting me know ahead of time\, or you may end up on
  the waitlist for future hikes.\n\n**Waitlist:**\nRegular hikers may get b
 umped up from the waitlist because I want to emphasize community first\, b
 ut if you are a regular that stops attending for a few months\, you could 
 lose that priority. Make sure to check your RSVP status\, even on the day 
 of the hike\, as it might change at the last minute! If you're still on th
 e waitlist\, please don't show up. Plus-ones for people on the waitlist ar
 en’t allowed—let's keep it fair for those eager to join!\n\n**Bringing
  a Plus-One:**\nIf you’re bringing a friend\, please select the +1 optio
 n when you RSVP or edit your response. It helps me keep an accurate headco
 unt! Make sure your guest is also up for the pace and distance.\n\n**Optio
 nal Rucking:**\nI will bring along a weighted pack (rucking) for an extra 
 challenge\, but it's totally optional! Rucking is great training for backp
 acking. If you’re carrying more than 15 lbs\, I recommend a proper backp
 ack designed for heavy loads to prevent discomfort or injury. If you’re 
 new to this\, start light!\n\n**Eats/Drinks:**\nTBD
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314500644
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T011841Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T011841Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
