SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance @ WWC w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 1st\nEvening Dance
  Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nDJ \\|
  Facilitator Kristikka\nIntention: Full Moon Frolic\nSomething magical awa
 its…what wants to unfold within you under this luminous Flower Full Moon
 ? Join us for an evening of outdoor dance at the Warren Wilson College pav
 ilion\, where moonlight and movement weave together in a field of possibil
 ity. Let the glow of the moon guide your journey as we dance beneath the s
 tars\, held by the elements and the rhythms of the wave.\n\nAbout the DJ\n
 DJ Kristikka\, Kris Hostikka loves creating a sacred container that takes 
 you on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment
  to chaos and down into stillness and integration. She feels that movement
  is medicine\, weaving intention and a rich blend of world beats where it
 ’s possible to be with what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt 
 and moved. You can find her dance mixes here: [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kr
 istikka](https://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4&fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU3h6d0laS3JUTEFScnc0NXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
 zOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7Vn9iVvuYU-yInCYvQ0MHAiyInBYBpfX0A4BYCV5MBHgAy1epguJGSO
 8tvDw_aem_S39M0EN52qlAHkPRDrlkoQ)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\\*\\* Please note that the 
 dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and an
 y that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe a
 nd secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\
 n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\
 n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://l.face
 book.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fashevillemovementcollective.org%2F...%2Fdjs
 eigea...%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU3h6d0laS3JUTEFScnc0NXNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7eQ1Pu9iP9dEnnuF0YJoZB9ozD0MSmDSF-3d4
 OkkPepMaSUpFZYws6jlR1Ig_aem_ZXhNAtjs7xRwPT1uxy7GqA&h=AT6NI8WTxVPWrOZtjCWF3
 EiUJriDD77qz5yywsBYcC-Z-E-H0hN_VrnsfLRakyU_fokIZIEsFo3nf1LYKi7DU2raqL7Kvoo
 p8q8DATl5mFy7ZkuX7vLSTt-_lYKO5y2eXS4sLHnvW928tdUKkbbUgr-_QI9-TyIsDg&__tn__
 =q&c%5B0%5D=AT6Dpi2O_FbAlLtndmWYMkLQSzQBMSxLr5qtdF_WXEY_RRFsSmTMMUmZ5DWrDQ
 bupVFlE_omhyZNyHqfSebLwRCefWIb55b3uUjG5ZJ3KWEA0X59Iobu3mEnZ1-NdqEkg78ryFD9
 s-KPUMjsG143LBsCNHfdo4yIG9I)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer 
 and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/voluntee
 r/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU3h6d0laS3JUTEFScnc0NXNydGMGYXBwX2lkED
 IyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4lxPoO1yE_dTNRZo08AqJtSVgmII1f9Ou7QW9_Ar4f1uLvWI8m
 gv8CTIjx6Q_aem_8jL71UcVOqD9XFHW6y1amg)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor w
 ill close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AF
 TER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\nCollective agreements:\n\n[https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%
 3A%2F%2Fashevillemovementcollective.org%2Four-dance%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bg
 NhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU3h6d0laS3JUTEFScnc0NXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4
 OTIAAR7rT_lV5sk5vyVdHT-711QU0GA5lZqEtDZEjJZmyBhuavtoZ3zIFBVsdcQU5A_aem_7J4
 5cWxM4ziUF5NQMfC-Tg&h=AT5TyY5fG53svF07Ad1TKcotx9jp_7WFcS3TfCcrEtJvGsZaycNk
 GLzIpElcase8W26BoWlKmxMaZES8olH3cMXwe9qvsUEPFjecgu6IoenjFN1pCqvDok9jhMQCMp
 G2SdFlBHh-Vt6R6RaUZs4YNKzvBn35N4QZHg&__tn__=q&c%5B0%5D=AT6Dpi2O_FbAlLtndmW
 YMkLQSzQBMSxLr5qtdF_WXEY_RRFsSmTMMUmZ5DWrDQbupVFlE_omhyZNyHqfSebLwRCefWIb5
 5b3uUjG5ZJ3KWEA0X59Iobu3mEnZ1-NdqEkg78ryFD9s-KPUMjsG143LBsCNHfdo4yIG9I)\nA
 bout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in h
 armony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving com
 munity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy commun
 ity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and commun
 ity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\n\\*\\* L
 ocation: Warren Wilson College Pavillion\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
