SUMMARY:'Locals Only' Ride at the Carolina Hills Classic
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260513T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T200000
UID:aa05bffff294b0836a71e1a50ece85fb@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Join a 'Locals Only' ride at the Carolina Hills Classic\, a un
 ique charity ride supporting the Arthritis Foundation and the 3.2M Carolin
 ians (adults and children) living wtih an arthritis diagnosis. Your ticket
  supports research\, advocacy\, programs and community connection for peop
 le living with arthritis\, the nation's leading cause of disability. Join 
 us for a robust program with your $250 donation: Wednesday\, May 13th : Pa
 cket pickup and evening welcome reception at our host hotel in downtown A
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
