  venue. From the front entrance into the main performing arts venue\, scul
 ptural elements blend with animations and motion graphics using cutting ed
 ge projection mapping technology. There is also a curated gallery that sho
 wcases seasonal art. Third Room is also a live music venue. Whether you go
  for psychedelic rock\, techno\, heavy metal\, or bluegrass\, Third Room o
 ffers wide open spaces to dance surrounded by captivating motion graphics
