 ning/depts/library/branch-locations/enka-candler.aspx<br><br><strong>A l
 ively language enrichment story time featuring songs\, rhymes\, bounces
 \, and books designed for children ages 0-18 months. <em>On this date\, t
 his program will take place in the children&#39\;s picture book room.</e
 m></strong><br><br>These early literacy programs for kids and their care
