SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Mikaya + Startribe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 29th\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nDJ \\
 | Facilitator Mikaya \\+ Startribe\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* 
 Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at 
 Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on ti
 me to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30
  or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registr
 ation Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseige
 a.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZ
 Xh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODg
 yMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_ae
 m_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and
  dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?
 fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyM
 jAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDtt
 Uv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will
  close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER
  OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillem
 ovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYX
 BwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEz
 r2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Mo
 vement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are fr
 ee to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and
  aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form d
 ance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC
  is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: TBA\n\nSee you on the
  dance floor!
