SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Servants of Music 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 31st\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nLIVE Music 
 w/ Servants of Music\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note th
 at the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle
  and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensu
 re a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name you
 r price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-regist
 ration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOL
 UNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to vol
 unteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://as
 hevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBEx
 VTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJG
 FESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQ
 A)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the op
 ening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCo
 llective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/]
 (https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CM
 TAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5
 CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2Jn
 rnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a wor
 ld that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves w
 ithin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity 
 and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for p
 ersonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organiz
 ation.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
